<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><script>document.documentElement.classList.add("js")</script>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Sisain Impact Dashboard</title>
<meta name="description" content="Sisain Impact Dashboard - hitung dampak bekal dan kurangi sampah makanan.">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27 viewBox=%270 0 100 100%27%3E%3Ctext y=%27.9em%27 font-size=%2790%27%3E%F0%9F%8C%BF%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,500;12..96,700;12..96,800&family=Figtree:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#06130D;--lime:#C6FF3D;--mint:#5CE1A0;--honey:#F2B33D;--ink:#EAF6EC;--mut:#9DBBA6;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,.055);--bd:rgba(255,255,255,.11);
box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:400 16px/1.6 'Figtree',system-ui,sans-serif;min-height:100vh;overflow-x:hidden;
background-image:radial-gradient(60vw 50vh at 85% -5%,rgba(198,255,61,.22),transparent 70%),radial-gradient(55vw 55vh at -10% 30%,rgba(31,140,80,.35),transparent 70%),radial-gradient(50vw 40vh at 70% 105%,rgba(92,225,160,.18),transparent 70%);background-attachment:fixed}
h1,h2,h3,.num{font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:22px 18px 90px}
header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;margin-bottom:22px}
header img{height:38px;width:auto;border-radius:10px;display:block}
.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--bd);padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:500;font-size:.92rem;color:var(--mut)}
.pill i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--lime);box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--lime);animation:pulse 1.8s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{50%{opacity:.35}}
.bento{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr);gap:16px}
.t{background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:28px;padding:24px;backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
@keyframes up{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)}}
.c4{grid-column:span 4}.c5{grid-column:span 5}.c6{grid-column:span 6}.c7{grid-column:span 7}.c8{grid-column:span 8}.c3{grid-column:span 3}.c12{grid-column:span 12}
@media(max-width:960px){.c3{grid-column:span 6}.c4,.c5,.c6,.c7,.c8{grid-column:span 12}}
@media(max-width:520px){.c3{grid-column:span 12}.t{padding:20px;border-radius:24px}}
.hero{padding:0;min-height:340px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end}
.hero>img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:saturate(1.1)}
.hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(6,19,13,.1) 10%,rgba(6,19,13,.92) 88%)}
.hero div{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:28px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5.4vw,3.8rem);font-weight:800;line-height:1.02}
.hero p{margin:12px 0 0;color:#CFE6D4;max-width:40ch}
.lab{color:var(--mut);font-weight:500;font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:10px;display:block}
h2{font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:14px}
.seg{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.seg button{flex:1;font:700 .98rem 'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:1px solid var(--bd);padding:11px 12px;border-radius:14px;cursor:pointer;transition:.15s}
.seg button:hover{border-color:var(--lime)}
.seg button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--lime);color:#0B2010;border-color:var(--lime);box-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(198,255,61,.35)}
.seg small{display:block;font:400 .78rem 'Figtree';opacity:.8}
.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin:20px 0 6px}
.row b{font:800 2rem 'Bricolage Grotesque',system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--lime)}
input[type=range]{width:100%;accent-color:var(--lime);height:30px}
.kpi .num{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5vw,3.6rem);font-weight:800;line-height:1;display:block;margin:6px 0 4px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.kpi small{color:var(--mut)}
.kpi.main{background:var(--lime);color:#0B2010;border-color:var(--lime);box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(198,255,61,.25)}
.kpi.main .lab,.kpi.main small{color:#1D3A12}
.ring{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.ring svg{width:140px;height:140px;flex:none}
.ring circle{fill:none;stroke-width:12}
.lv{font:800 1.9rem 'Bricolage Grotesque',system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--honey);line-height:1.1}
#bars{width:100%;height:220px;display:block}
#bars rect{transition:height .5s,y .5s,fill .3s}
.tip{color:var(--mut);font-size:.93rem}
.cta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px}
.btn{font:700 1rem 'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;text-decoration:none;border:0;cursor:pointer;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:14px;color:#0B2010;background:var(--honey);transition:transform .15s,box-shadow .15s}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.35)}
.btn.g{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--bd)}
.scan{padding:0;min-height:260px}
.scan>img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.scan:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(6,19,13,.95) 8%,transparent 70%)}
.scan div{position:absolute;z-index:2;left:22px;right:22px;bottom:20px}
details{margin-top:14px;color:var(--mut)}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
.as{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}
.as label{font-size:.85rem}.as input{width:100%;margin-top:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border:1px solid var(--bd);color:var(--ink);padding:9px 12px;border-radius:12px;font:inherit}
.ps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}.ps .num{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3.6vw,2.4rem);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;display:block;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.ps>div:nth-child(3) .num{color:var(--lime)}
.bar{height:14px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);margin-top:20px;overflow:hidden}.bar i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--mint),var(--lime));transition:width .8s}
@media(max-width:700px){.ps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
.note{margin-top:30px;color:var(--mut);font-size:.88rem;text-align:center}
#toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:calc(26px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));transform:translate(-50%,30px);background:var(--lime);color:#0B2010;font-weight:700;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:999px;opacity:0;transition:.3s;z-index:9}
#toast.on{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--honey);outline-offset:3px}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}

.blob{position:fixed;z-index:-1;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(80px);animation:fl 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate;pointer-events:none}
.b1{width:42vw;height:42vw;left:-12vw;top:8vh;background:#1F8C50;opacity:.45}.b2{width:34vw;height:34vw;right:-8vw;top:38vh;background:#9BD32A;opacity:.2;animation-duration:24s}.b3{width:38vw;height:38vw;left:30vw;bottom:-18vh;background:#0F6B45;opacity:.5;animation-duration:20s}
@keyframes fl{to{transform:translate(9vw,-7vh) scale(1.2)}}
.js .t{opacity:0;transform:translateY(34px);transition:opacity .8s,transform .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),border-color .3s;transition-delay:calc(var(--i,0)*60ms)}
.js .t.in{opacity:1;transform:none}.js .t.in:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);border-color:rgba(198,255,61,.5)}
.hero>img{animation:kb 20s ease-in-out infinite alternate}@keyframes kb{to{transform:scale(1.12) translate(-1.5%,-1%)}}
.rw{color:var(--lime);display:inline-block;transition:opacity .35s,transform .35s}.rw.o{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-.35em)}
.mq{overflow:hidden;margin:0 -18px 22px;border-block:1px solid var(--bd);padding:12px 0;white-space:nowrap}
.mq div{display:inline-flex;animation:mq 34s linear infinite;font:700 1.1rem 'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif}
.mq span{margin-right:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:34px}.mq span:after{content:"";width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--lime);box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--lime)}
@keyframes mq{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}
.btn{position:relative;overflow:hidden}.btn:after{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:-70%;width:40%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(100deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,.55),transparent);transform:skewX(-20deg);animation:sh 3.6s infinite}
@keyframes sh{60%,100%{left:140%}}
#bars.go rect{transform-box:fill-box;transform-origin:bottom;animation:grow .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) both;animation-delay:calc(var(--k)*50ms)}@keyframes grow{from{transform:scaleY(0)}}
#cost{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}#cost.go .ln{stroke-dasharray:1;animation:dr 1.6s ease both}@keyframes dr{from{stroke-dashoffset:1}}
.sh{grid-column:span 12;margin:34px 0 2px}.sh h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.7rem);font-weight:800;margin:0}.sh p{color:var(--mut);max-width:62ch;margin:8px 0 0}
.cr{display:grid;grid-template-columns:84px 1fr 1fr;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--bd);font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.4}.cr span{color:var(--mut)}.cr em{font-style:normal;color:var(--lime);font-weight:700}.cr.h{border:0;font-weight:700;padding-top:0}
.js .cr{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-18px);transition:.6s;transition-delay:calc(var(--k)*110ms + .3s)}.js .t.in .cr{opacity:1;transform:none}
.days{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:8px;margin:16px 0}.days button{aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--bd);background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:var(--ink);font:800 1.1rem 'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:.25s}.days button:hover{border-color:var(--lime)}
.days button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--lime);color:#0B2010;transform:scale(1.1) rotate(-5deg);box-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(198,255,61,.45)}
.ps{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.cf{position:fixed;left:50%;top:60%;width:9px;height:14px;border-radius:2px;z-index:99;pointer-events:none}
.faq details{border-top:1px solid var(--bd);padding:14px 0;margin:0}.faq details[open] p{animation:fd .4s}@keyframes fd{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-8px)}}
.cta2{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1F8C50,#0B3D24)!important;text-align:center;padding:56px 24px}.cta2 h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,5vw,3.2rem);font-weight:800}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.js .t,.js .cr{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<i class="blob b1"></i><i class="blob b2"></i><i class="blob b3"></i>
<div class="wrap">
<header><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Sisain – Wadah Baik, Langkah Hijau"><span class="pill"><i></i>Dashboard dampak kamu</span></header>

<div class="mq" aria-hidden="true"><div id="mq"></div></div>
<main class="bento">
<section class="t hero c7" style="--i:0"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Wadah Sisain berisi nasi, lauk, dan sayur"><div>
<h1>Berapa banyak <span class="rw" id="rw">bumi</span> yang kamu selamatkan?</h1>
<p>Geser, pilih, dan lihat dampak nyata dari satu kebiasaan kecil: bawa wadah sendiri.</p></div></section>

<section class="t c5" style="--i:1">
<h2>Atur kebiasaanmu</h2>
<span class="lab">Ukuran wadah</span>
<div class="seg" id="size"><button data-v="300" aria-pressed="false">Small<small>300 ml</small><small>Rp45.900</small></button><button data-v="600" aria-pressed="true">Medium<small>600 ml</small><small>Rp67.900</small></button><button data-v="1000" aria-pressed="false">Large<small>1.000 ml</small><small>Rp93.900</small></button></div>
<div class="row"><span class="lab" style="margin:0">Pakai Sisain per minggu</span><b id="fv">5×</b></div>
<input id="freq" type="range" min="1" max="14" value="5" aria-label="Frekuensi pemakaian per minggu">
<span class="lab" style="margin-top:14px">Periode</span>
<div class="seg" id="per"><button data-v="1" aria-pressed="false">1 bulan</button><button data-v="6" aria-pressed="false">6 bulan</button><button data-v="12" aria-pressed="true">1 tahun</button></div>
</section>

<section class="t kpi main c3" style="--i:2"><span class="lab">Kemasan sekali pakai terhindar</span><span class="num" id="k1">0</span><small>buah</small></section>
<section class="t kpi c3" style="--i:3"><span class="lab">Hemat belanja kemasan</span><span class="num" id="k2">0</span><small>perkiraan rupiah</small></section>
<section class="t kpi c3" style="--i:4"><span class="lab">Makanan tidak terbuang</span><span class="num" id="k3">0</span><small>liter sisa makanan dibawa pulang</small></section>
<section class="t kpi c3" style="--i:5"><span class="lab">Sampah kemasan berkurang</span><span class="num" id="k4">0</span><small id="u4">gram</small></section>


<section class="t c7" style="--i:7"><h2>Dampakmu terus bertumbuh</h2>
<p class="tip" style="margin:-6px 0 8px">Kumulatif kemasan terhindar per bulan. Batang terang adalah periode yang kamu pilih.</p>
<svg id="bars" viewBox="0 0 600 220" role="img" aria-label="Grafik kumulatif kemasan sekali pakai yang terhindar per bulan"></svg></section>

<section class="t c5" style="--i:7"><h2>Level hijau kamu</h2>
<div class="ring"><svg viewBox="0 0 140 140"><circle cx="70" cy="70" r="54" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.12)"/><circle id="rg" cx="70" cy="70" r="54" stroke="var(--lime)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="339.3" stroke-dashoffset="339.3" transform="rotate(-90 70 70)" style="transition:stroke-dashoffset .8s"/><text id="rp" x="70" y="78" text-anchor="middle" fill="#EAF6EC" font-family="Bricolage Grotesque" font-weight="800" font-size="26">0%</text></svg>
<div><div class="lv" id="lv">Pemula Hijau</div><p class="tip" id="lt" style="margin:6px 0 0"></p></div></div>
<div class="cta"><button class="btn" id="share">Bagikan hasilku</button><a class="btn g" href="https://instagram.com/bysisain" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@bysisain</a></div></section>

<section class="t scan c4" style="--i:8"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Scan kode QR pada wadah Sisain"><div><h3 style="font-size:1.5rem">Scan, pahami, pakai.</h3><p class="tip" style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#CFE6D4">Kode QR di tutup berisi panduan pakai, cara cuci, dan tips perawatan.</p></div></section>

<section class="t c8" style="--i:9"><h2>Kenapa Sisain bikin ketagihan</h2>
<div class="bento" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px">
<div><h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--lime)">3 kompartemen</h3><p class="tip" style="margin:4px 0 0">Nasi, lauk, dan sayur tidak tercampur.</p></div>
<div><h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--lime)">Tutup rapat berpengunci</h3><p class="tip" style="margin:4px 0 0">Aman dibawa ke kampus tanpa tumpah.</p></div>
<div><h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--lime)">Seal dan sekat lepas-pasang</h3><p class="tip" style="margin:4px 0 0">Gampang dicuci sampai ke sela-selanya.</p></div>
<div><h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--lime)">Food grade, BPA-free</h3><p class="tip" style="margin:4px 0 0">Kuat, tahan lama, aman untuk makananmu.</p></div></div>
<details><summary>Ubah asumsi perhitungan</summary>
<div class="as"><label>Harga kemasan sekali pakai (Rp)<input id="hg" type="number" value="1500" min="0"></label><label>Berat kemasan (gram)<input id="bt" type="number" value="8" min="0"></label></div></details>
</section>

<div class="sh"><h2>Kenapa kebiasaan kecil ini penting?</h2><p>Susut dan sisa pangan di Indonesia, dari produksi sampai ke piring, jumlahnya sangat besar. Menurut kajian Bappenas bersama Waste4Change dan WRI (2021):</p></div>
<section class="t kpi c3" style="--i:0"><span class="lab">Susut dan sisa pangan per tahun</span><span class="num"><span class="cu" data-to="23">23</span>–<span class="cu" data-to="48">48</span></span><small>juta ton (periode 2000–2019)</small></section>
<section class="t kpi c3" style="--i:1"><span class="lab">Per orang per tahun</span><span class="num"><span class="cu" data-to="115">115</span>–<span class="cu" data-to="184">184</span></span><small>kilogram makanan</small></section>
<section class="t kpi c3" style="--i:2"><span class="lab">Kerugian ekonomi per tahun</span><span class="num">Rp<span class="cu" data-to="213">213</span>–<span class="cu" data-to="551">551</span></span><small>triliun, setara 4 sampai 5 persen PDB</small></section>
<section class="t kpi c3" style="--i:3"><span class="lab">Setara porsi makan untuk</span><span class="num"><span class="cu" data-to="61">61</span>–<span class="cu" data-to="125">125</span></span><small>juta orang per tahun</small></section>
<section class="t c12" style="--i:0"><p class="tip" style="margin:0">Angka di atas mencakup seluruh rantai pangan, bukan hanya sisa di meja makan. Dampak iklimnya pun besar: setara 7,29 persen rata-rata emisi gas rumah kaca Indonesia. Kamu tidak bisa mengubah semuanya, tapi bagian di piringmu sepenuhnya ada di tanganmu. Sumber: Kajian Food Loss and Waste di Indonesia (Bappenas, Waste4Change, WRI, 2021).</p></section>

<div class="sh"><h2>Sisain atau sekali pakai?</h2><p>Bandingkan Sisain dengan membeli kemasan sekali pakai terus-menerus.</p></div>
<section class="t c12" style="--i:0"><h2>Sisain vs sekali pakai</h2>
<div class="cr h"><span></span><span>Kemasan sekali pakai</span><em>Sisain</em></div>
<div class="cr" style="--k:1"><b>Pemakaian</b><span>Sekali, lalu dibuang</span><em>Berulang kali</em></div>
<div class="cr" style="--k:2"><b>Pemisah lauk</b><span>Umumnya tanpa sekat</span><em>3 kompartemen, sekat lepas-pasang</em></div>
<div class="cr" style="--k:3"><b>Penutup</b><span>Tutup sederhana</span><em>Pengunci dan seal silikon</em></div>
<div class="cr" style="--k:4"><b>Biaya</b><span>Beli terus setiap makan</span><em>Sekali beli, balik modal</em></div>
<div class="cr" style="--k:5"><b>Panduan</b><span>Tidak ada</span><em>Kode QR di tutup</em></div>
</section>

<div class="sh"><h2>Ikut tantangan, ajak teman</h2></div>
<section class="t c6" style="--i:0"><h2>Tantangan 7 hari bawa bekal</h2><p class="tip" style="margin:0">Ketuk setiap hari kamu membawa Sisain. Progres tersimpan di perangkatmu.</p>
<div class="days" id="days"></div><div class="bar"><i id="cb"></i></div><p class="tip" id="cm" style="margin:10px 0 12px"></p><button class="btn g" id="rst">Mulai ulang</button></section>
<section class="t c6" style="--i:1"><h2>Kalau satu kampus ikut?</h2><p class="tip" style="margin:0">Dengan kebiasaanmu saat ini, geser jumlah teman yang ikut membawa Sisain.</p>
<div class="row"><span class="lab" style="margin:0">Jumlah pengguna</span><b id="fn">10 orang</b></div><input id="fr" type="range" min="1" max="500" value="10" aria-label="Jumlah pengguna">
<div class="ps" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);margin-top:14px"><div><span class="lab">Kemasan terhindar per tahun</span><span class="num" id="m1">0</span></div><div><span class="lab">Hemat per tahun</span><span class="num" id="m2">0</span></div><div><span class="lab">Makanan terselamatkan</span><span class="num" id="m3">0</span></div></div></section>

<div class="sh"><h2>Rawat sedikit, awet lama</h2><p>Tiga kebiasaan sederhana supaya Sisain tetap bersih dan nyaman dipakai.</p></div>
<section class="t scan c4" style="--i:0"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Mencuci wadah Sisain dengan sabun dan spons"><div><h3 style="font-size:1.4rem">Cuci dengan sabun lembut</h3><p class="tip" style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#CFE6D4">Spons lembut dan air mengalir sudah cukup.</p></div></section>
<section class="t scan c4" style="--i:1"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Melepas seal silikon dari tutup"><div><h3 style="font-size:1.4rem">Lepas seal dan sekat</h3><p class="tip" style="margin:6px 0 0;color:#CFE6D4">Semua bagian bisa dilepas agar bersih sampai ke sela.</p></div></section>
